  "title": "Cream Puffs",
  "description": "Cream puffs made with choux pastry that puffs up when baked; fill with vanilla cream and drizzle melted chocolate on top for a crowd-pleasing dessert.",
  "authors": [
    "Shellie Wendel"
  ],
  "date_published": "2000-01-28T09:58:14-05:00",
